%% Mermaid state diagram: Work Product lifecycle v1
%%{init: {"state": {"htmlLabels": false}}}%%
stateDiagram-v2
  [*] --> PROCESSING : derive / transform
  PROCESSING --> FAILED : system error / dependency
  FAILED --> PROCESSING : retry / repair
  PROCESSING --> PENDING_JUDGMENT : submit to Guardian
  PENDING_JUDGMENT --> QUARANTINED : Guardian BLOCK
  QUARANTINED --> PROCESSING : remediation
  QUARANTINED --> CLEARED_FOR_USE : waiver approval
  PENDING_JUDGMENT --> CLEARED_FOR_USE : PASS/WARN
  CLEARED_FOR_USE --> PROCESSING : regenerate successor
  CLEARED_FOR_USE --> [*]

  note right of CLEARED_FOR_USE
    Downstream agents (Analyze, Compose, Timeline)
    may spawn Candidate Deliverables or additional WP.
    Retention/erasure can transition from any state.
  end note
